{
 "_doc": [
  "Map icons of the style bundle. Every entry becomes one sprite image (1x and 2x, light and dark).",
  "source 'upstream': assets/icons/upstream/<name>.svg, extracted from Protomaps' refill.svg group '_<upstream_id>' by packbuilder/map/style/import_upstream_icons.py (tangrams/icons derivative, MIT).",
  "source 'beamline': assets/icons/beamline/<name>.svg, drawn for this project in the same frame (MIT).",
  "The SVGs use grey template colours. build_sprites.py maps each colour channel c (0-255) to mix(pair[0], pair[1], c/255), where pair is the icon's 'color' in the flavor of the sheet (the rule of Protomaps' spritegen). So #000 becomes pair[0], #fff becomes pair[1].",
  "Flavor pairs copied from protomaps/basemaps sprites/flavors/{light,dark}.json at 42ffaaa4: base, arrow, green, lapis, slategray, blue, tangerine, pink. Added for driving: auto, road, health, lodging, parking (lapis by day, a brighter blue at night so parking reads on the dark map), plus 'label' text colours used by the style for each colour group.",
  "Added for saved places (docs/architecture-saved-places.md 8, a draft for the owner's approval): 'saved', the route's blue B (casing by day, fill by night) with white, used only by saved_home, saved_work and saved_place, which are filled (frame #000, glyph #fff) and drawn by the app's saved-places layer and the search rows, not by the style's POIs, so the group has no label colour."
 ],
